  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Advocacy on Climate Change &amp; Green Transition</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Strategic Objectives 1) Tackling of climate change challenges and dismissal of myths in Pakistan; 2) Cultivation of change in an average Pakistani and encouragement of local and federal authorities to promote climate response measures and address negative impact of climate change; 3) Promotion of renewable energy and energy efficiency in Pakistan.</narrative>
